---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Chris Thomas" description="Product manager. Non-linear background.">
  <main class="about-page">
    <a href="/hall" class="back mono">← hallway</a>
    <p class="mono eyebrow">about</p>
    <h1>product manager.<br /><em>non-linear background.</em></h1>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <div class="about-body">
      <p>i work in product management at the intersection of health, technology, and distributed teams. currently at avaana, an australian healthtech startup, where i own product strategy, roadmap, and a lot of the coordination that keeps things from falling apart.</p>
      <p>my background is non-linear — nonprofit work, QA, a few detours that don't fit neatly on a CV, and then product. i think the roundabout path is part of why i find disparate things interesting and want to connect them.</p>
      <p>this site is mostly a place to think out loud. topics vary: technology, geopolitics, consciousness, magick, things i couldn't stop thinking about. no particular agenda. the range is the point.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="mono section-label">elsewhere</p>
    <nav class="about-links">
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/chris-thomas396" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        LinkedIn <span class="arrow">↗</span>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 2rem 6rem;
  }

  .back {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    transition: color 0.3s var(--ease-drift);
  }
  .back:hover { color: var(--color-gold); opacity: 1; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .about-body p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 1.25em;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .about-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-links {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .about-links a {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: color 0.3s var(--ease-drift);
  }

  .about-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
